# Agent harness (GIS2DGS)

Agent = Model + Harness. This repo's harness is AGENTS.md + skills + `.cursor/hooks` + `scripts/agent_harness`.

## Always

- Read `skills/gis2dgs/SKILL.md` before changing code.
- Keep one repo; no parallel converter projects.
- Map by schema/YAML adapters — never `if ArcGIS` / `if IGEA`.
- Put results under `output/`.
- After code changes, run `python scripts/run_verify_gate.py` before claiming done.

## Ask first

- `git commit` / `git push`
- Docker teardown / SQL Server restore against non-example data
- Any change that touches credentials or company IDs

## Never

- Force-push, `git reset --hard`, recursive force deletes
- Overwrite `data/reference/real/`
- Hardcode credentials or personal paths
- Skip `NetworkModel` / validation to write DGS directly from tables

## Sensors

- Soft stop-gate nudges when `.cursor/harness/pending_verify` exists
- Strict mode: set `GIS2DGS_HARNESS_STRICT=1` to auto-run the full verify gate on stop
